      "promptEs": "dejé",
      "answerEn": "I stopped (doing something)",
      "noteEn": "Here dejé is the completed-past form of dejar in dejar de followed by an action, the pattern for stopping that activity. Without de, dejé commonly means “I left” or “I left something in a state.”",
      "example": { "es": "Dejé de correr.", "en": "I stopped running." },
      "tags": ["word", "dejar de", "completed past", "A2"]
    }
  ],
